{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sneak peek for Brewed and Battered. In this demo, you'll have access to one of the 20 alchemists and one of the 5 stages that will be available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew your own weapons from scratch and unleash them on hordes of homunculi! In this bullet heaven survival roguelite, every ingredient combination creates a custom potion that splashes, moves, and reacts in a unique way. Discover absurd synergies and rescue fellow alchemists in your quest for the Philosopher\u2019s Stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/718381edcdb5de0b94a4cfdcb688be7e.poster.avif?t=1762388777\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/718381edcdb5de0b94a4cfdcb688be7e.webm?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/718381edcdb5de0b94a4cfdcb688be7e.mp4?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ingredients in classic level-up shop and combine them in a not-so-classic brewing system.\u00a0Collect sulfur when on the move to upgrade your ingredients and potions. Gather mercury while stationary and use it to buy new ingredients. Burn, electrocute, douse, heal, and freeze your way through swarms of unnatural constructs guarding the secrets of Azoth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/94c5135e0cc1334d9c234fbacb6e2ebe.poster.avif?t=1762388777\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/94c5135e0cc1334d9c234fbacb6e2ebe.webm?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/94c5135e0cc1334d9c234fbacb6e2ebe.mp4?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Potions:</strong>\u00a0Every potion you use to fight enemies or bolster your defenses is brewed from scratch using ingredients you've collected. Each ingredient creates a new effect when combined with a potion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Runs:</strong>\u00a0Every battle lasts 20 minutes (or shorter).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Resource System:</strong>\u00a0Build your alchemist by spending mercury and sulfur. Enemies drop sulfur when you are moving and can be used to upgrade potions and ingredients. Enemies drop mercury when you are stationary and can be used to acquire new ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Fire:</strong>\u00a0Potions are thrown on an interval and aimed based on their ingredients.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4151760?t=1762388777","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4151760?t=1762388777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/e63a5ca69724f60ba675784519fc352c4a167dfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762388777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/e63a5ca69724f60ba675784519fc352c4a167dfa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762388777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sneak peek for Brewed and Battered. In this demo, you'll have access to one of the 20 alchemists and one of the 5 stages that will be available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew your own weapons from scratch and unleash them on hordes of homunculi! In this bullet heaven survival roguelite, every ingredient combination creates a custom potion that splashes, moves, and reacts in a unique way. Discover absurd synergies and rescue fellow alchemists in your quest for the Philosopher\u2019s Stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/718381edcdb5de0b94a4cfdcb688be7e.poster.avif?t=1762388777\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/718381edcdb5de0b94a4cfdcb688be7e.webm?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/718381edcdb5de0b94a4cfdcb688be7e.mp4?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ingredients in classic level-up shop and combine them in a not-so-classic brewing system.\u00a0Collect sulfur when on the move to upgrade your ingredients and potions. Gather mercury while stationary and use it to buy new ingredients. Burn, electrocute, douse, heal, and freeze your way through swarms of unnatural constructs guarding the secrets of Azoth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/94c5135e0cc1334d9c234fbacb6e2ebe.poster.avif?t=1762388777\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/94c5135e0cc1334d9c234fbacb6e2ebe.webm?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/extras/94c5135e0cc1334d9c234fbacb6e2ebe.mp4?t=1762388777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Potions:</strong>\u00a0Every potion you use to fight enemies or bolster your defenses is brewed from scratch using ingredients you've collected. Each ingredient creates a new effect when combined with a potion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Runs:</strong>\u00a0Every battle lasts 20 minutes (or shorter).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Resource System:</strong>\u00a0Build your alchemist by spending mercury and sulfur. Enemies drop sulfur when you are moving and can be used to upgrade potions and ingredients. Enemies drop mercury when you are stationary and can be used to acquire new ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Fire:</strong>\u00a0Potions are thrown on an interval and aimed based on their ingredients.</p></li></ul>","developers":["By Truan"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3921670","name":"Brewed and Battered"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151760/3ea259796c2185ef73dab53bf6895cfb56c8c5ee/header.jpg?t=1762388777","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4151760/635734234/cd4234889e62b2ecff0f50b3d8ead0f9171a0691/1762046293/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762316989","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4151760/635734234/cd4234